    { "what": "IO35, IO36 and IO37", "pins": ["IO35", "IO36", "IO37"], "why": "Table 3-1 note b: on a module with octal SPI PSRAM, pins IO35, IO36 and IO37 are connected to that PSRAM and are not available for other uses. The kind has no pad for GPIO33 to GPIO37." },
