    { "what": "crystal, flash, PSRAM and RF passives", "why": "The features list includes a 40 MHz crystal oscillator. Figure 8-1 labels Y1 40 MHz, ±10 ppm, and says C1 and C4 vary with the crystal. It does not name the crystal package, so none is placed. The kind's clock is that 40 MHz. Table 1-1 gives this ordering 16 MB quad flash and 8 MB octal PSRAM, and note 4 says the PSRAM is in the chip package. C13 (0.1 uF) and C14 (1 uF) on VDD_SPI, the RF matching network (L2, L3, C5, C11, C12), L1 (2.0 nH) in the VDD3P3 feed, R3 (499 ohm), R4 and D1 are not placed; C9 sits directly on 3V3." }
